{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02746","headline":"中和乐九章 歌明堂第二 · 卢照邻","name":"中和乐九章 歌明堂第二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"穆穆圣皇，雍雍明堂。\n左平右墄，上圆下方。\n调均风雨，制度阴阳。\n四牕八达，五室九房。\n南通夏火，西瞰秋霜。\n天子临御，万玉锵锵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02746.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02746","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}